<rml>
<head>
	<title>Friends</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../shell.rml"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="friends.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- Friends (docs/DESIGN.md 7.3, 10): a Xerces account, friends with
     presence, requests, invites, invite links, blocks and privacy. Data:
     the "friends" model in src/xerces_launcher/views/friends.cpp; the
     network work is src/xerces_launcher/friends_service.cpp's. -->
<body template="shell" data-model="friends">
<div id="friends-main">
	<div class="friends-primary">
		<div class="page-title">Friends</div>

		<div data-if="!available">
			<div class="page-sub">This build has no Xerces server to talk to, so friends and invites are off. Joining a friend works through Servers with their address.</div>
		</div>

		<div data-if="available &amp;&amp; !signed_in">
			<div class="page-sub">With a Xerces account your friends see when you are online or in a game, and you can invite each other to your lobby. Offline and LAN play never need one.</div>
			<div class="section account-form">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Sign in or make an account</span></div>
				<div class="label field-label">Username</div>
				<input id="login-name" type="text" class="text account-field" maxlength="24" data-value="login_name"/>
				<div class="label field-label">Password</div>
				<input id="login-password" type="password" class="text account-field" maxlength="128" data-value="login_password"/>
				<div class="field-problem" data-if="form_problem != ''">{{form_problem}}</div>
				<div class="field-note">A username has 3 to 24 letters, digits, '_', '.' or '-'. A new password needs at least 10 characters. Xerces keeps your sign-in on this PC, encrypted for your Windows account, and never your password.</div>
				<div class="toolbar account-actions">
					<button id="sign-in" class="primary-button default-focus" data-event-click="act('sign in')"><span>Sign in</span></button>
					<button id="sign-up" class="outline" data-event-click="act('sign up')"><span>Make an account</span></button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div data-if="available &amp;&amp; signed_in">
			<div class="account-line">
				<span class="account-name">{{username}}</span>
				<span class="account-state" data-class-live="connected">{{connection}}</span>
				<button id="sign-out" class="link" data-event-click="act('sign out')"><span>Sign out</span></button>
			</div>

			<div class="section join-panel" data-if="join_active">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">{{join_title}}</span></div>
				<div class="join-status">{{join_status}}</div>
				<div class="friend-row" data-for="m, i : join_mods">
					<div class="friend-text"><div class="friend-name">{{m.name}}</div></div>
					<div class="row-actions">
						<button class="small-button" data-if="m.on_workshop" data-attr-id="'join-mod-' + i" data-event-click="row('mod page', i)"><span>Workshop page</span></button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="toolbar join-actions">
					<button id="join-go" class="primary-button" data-if="join_ready" data-event-click="act('join go')"><span>Join</span></button>
					<button id="join-next" class="outline" data-if="join_pages" data-event-click="act('join next')"><span>Open the next Workshop page</span></button>
					<button id="join-cancel" class="outline" data-event-click="act('join cancel')"><span>Cancel</span></button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section join-panel" data-if="rejoin &amp;&amp; !join_active">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Rejoin</span></div>
				<div class="join-status">{{rejoin_text}}</div>
				<div class="toolbar join-actions">
					<button id="rejoin" class="primary-button" data-event-click="act('rejoin')"><span>Rejoin</span></button>
					<button id="rejoin-close" class="outline" data-event-click="act('rejoin close')"><span>Not now</span></button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section" data-if="knocks.size > 0">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Asking to join</span></div>
				<div class="friend-row" data-for="k, i : knocks">
					<div class="friend-text"><div class="friend-name">{{k.name}}</div></div>
					<div class="row-actions">
						<button class="small-button" data-if="hosting" data-attr-id="'knock-let-' + i" data-event-click="row('let in', i)"><span>Let in</span></button>
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'knock-ignore-' + i" data-event-click="row('knock ignore', i)"><span>Ignore</span></button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="invite-note" data-if="!hosting">Open your lobby to direct connect in the game to let them in.</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section" data-if="invites.size > 0">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Invites</span></div>
				<div class="friend-row invite-row" data-for="v, i : invites">
					<div class="friend-text"><div class="friend-name">{{v.text}}</div></div>
					<div class="row-actions">
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'invite-join-' + i" data-event-click="row('join', i)"><span>Join</span></button>
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'invite-ignore-' + i" data-event-click="row('ignore', i)"><span>Decline</span></button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section" data-if="incoming.size > 0">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Friend requests</span></div>
				<div class="friend-row" data-for="r, i : incoming">
					<div class="friend-text"><div class="friend-name">{{r.name}}</div></div>
					<div class="row-actions">
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'request-accept-' + i" data-event-click="row('accept', i)"><span>Accept</span></button>
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'request-decline-' + i" data-event-click="row('decline', i)"><span>Decline</span></button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section">
				<div class="panel-head">
					<span class="panel-title">Friends</span>
					<span class="panel-count">{{friend_count}}</span>
				</div>
				<div class="friend-row" data-for="f, i : friends" data-class-offline="!f.online">
					<span class="presence-dot" data-class-on="f.online"></span>
					<div class="friend-text">
						<div class="friend-name">{{f.name}}</div>
						<div class="friend-status">{{f.status}}</div>
					</div>
					<div class="row-actions">
						<button class="small-button" data-if="hosting" data-attr-id="'friend-invite-' + i" data-event-click="row('invite', i)"><span>Invite</span></button>
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'friend-remove-' + i" data-event-click="row('remove', i)"><span>Remove</span></button>
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'friend-block-' + i" data-event-click="row('block', i)"><span>Block</span></button>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="empty-note" data-if="friends.size == 0">No friends yet. Send a request with their Xerces username below.</div>
				<div class="invite-note">{{invite_note}}</div>

				<div class="label field-label">Add a friend</div>
				<div class="add-fields">
					<input id="add-name" type="text" class="text add-name" maxlength="24" data-attr-placeholder="add_placeholder" data-value="add_name"/>
					<button id="add-friend" class="outline add-button" data-event-click="act('add')"><span>Send request</span></button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="section" data-if="outgoing.size > 0">
				<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Requests you sent</span></div>
				<div class="friend-row" data-for="r, i : outgoing">
					<div class="friend-text"><div class="friend-name">{{r.name}}</div></div>
					<div class="row-actions">
						<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'request-cancel-' + i" data-event-click="row('cancel', i)"><span>Cancel</span></button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="friends-aside" data-if="available &amp;&amp; signed_in">
		<div>
			<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Privacy</span></div>
			<div class="privacy-row">
				<div class="privacy-text">Friend requests from</div>
				<button id="privacy-requests" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('privacy requests')"><span>{{privacy_requests}}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div class="privacy-row">
				<div class="privacy-text">Who sees you online</div>
				<button id="privacy-presence" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('privacy presence')"><span>{{privacy_presence}}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div class="privacy-row">
				<div class="privacy-text">Game invites from</div>
				<button id="privacy-invites" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('privacy invites')"><span>{{privacy_invites}}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div class="aside-note quiet">Friends see only whether you are online or in a game, its mode, and whether its lobby is open. An invite gives the friend your lobby's internet address and port, as direct connect does.</div>
		</div>

		<div data-if="blocks.size > 0">
			<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Blocked</span></div>
			<div class="friend-row" data-for="b, i : blocks">
				<div class="friend-text"><div class="friend-name">{{b.name}}</div></div>
				<div class="row-actions">
					<button class="small-button" data-attr-id="'unblock-' + i" data-event-click="row('unblock', i)"><span>Unblock</span></button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div>
			<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Invite link</span></div>
			<div data-if="has_link">
				<div class="link-url">{{link_url}}</div>
				<div class="toolbar link-actions">
					<button id="link-copy" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('link copy')"><span>Copy</span></button>
					<button id="link-new" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('link make')"><span>New link</span></button>
					<button id="link-stop" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('link stop')"><span>Stop</span></button>
				</div>
			</div>
			<button id="link-make" class="small-button" data-if="!has_link" data-event-click="act('link make')"><span>Make an invite link</span></button>
			<div class="aside-note">Anyone with the link can ask to join your lobby, friend or not; you choose who gets in. A link lasts a day.</div>
			<div class="label field-label">Join with a link</div>
			<div class="add-fields">
				<input id="link-input" type="text" class="text add-name" maxlength="200" data-attr-placeholder="link_placeholder" data-value="link_input"/>
				<button id="link-join" class="outline add-button" data-event-click="act('link join')"><span>Ask to join</span></button>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div>
			<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Your lobby</span></div>
			<div class="privacy-row">
				<div class="privacy-text">Who can join</div>
				<button id="lobby-guests" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('lobby guests')"><span>{{lobby_guests}}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div class="privacy-row">
				<div class="privacy-text">Follow hosts you join</div>
				<button id="follow-hosts" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('follow')"><span>{{follow_text}}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div class="privacy-row">
				<div class="privacy-text">Open invite links in Xerces</div>
				<button id="links-open" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('links open')"><span>{{links_open_text}}</span></button>
			</div>
			<div class="aside-note quiet">Invited players: only players you invite from Xerces get into your lobby, each with a ticket of their own. Follow: when a host you joined invites you again (a new lobby, other mods), Xerces joins at once.</div>
		</div>

		<div>
			<div class="panel-head"><span class="panel-title">Invites</span></div>
			<div class="aside-note">Host a lobby, open it to direct connect, then press Invite next to a friend. They get a toast in the game and an entry here. Join gets your mods from the Workshop if they lack any, then joins from the main menu or starts the game. Xerces asks your router to let them in; if your router refuses, forward the game's UDP port as for direct connect.</div>
			<button id="friends-refresh" class="small-button" data-event-click="act('refresh')"><span>Refresh</span></button>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
